          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.85" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Intense strikes on ports, rail, energy and logistics nodes in and around the theater directly interrupt export flows and transit corridors, causing immediate rerouting, congestion and shortages that raise supply‑chain disruption levels affecting U.S. supply lines and global intermediate goods." />
