          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Higher volumes of arms transfers from Russia or third parties to regional states and militias expand their anti-ship and naval strike capabilities, enabling more kinetic operations against maritime and energy infrastructure in Gulf/Red Sea littorals." />
