          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Acute shortages of chips and memory depress manufacturing output and freight activity in major importers (notably China), lowering near-term fuel and industrial oil demand and putting downward pressure on benchmark crude prices." />
