          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Acute repo market illiquidity forces banks and logistics firms to pull back short‑term credit and pre‑financing for freight and bunkering, causing delayed clearances and bunching of sailings that increase congestion at chokepoints." />
