          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A faster pace of new trade measures raises policy uncertainty and forces frequent repricing of cross-border credit risk and sovereign spreads, directly increasing realized and implied volatility in global bond markets." />
