          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A faster pace of new trade measures and countermeasures prompts regulators and security agencies to expand oversight, tighten export controls and increase review requirements for cross‑border AI R&amp;D and technology transfers." />
